  "description": "Kuwa.OData.Client is a metadata-driven OData V4 and V4.01 client for .NET 10. It reads the service metadata\n\t\t\tand lets you query and modify OData services through a fluent, typed, dictionary-based or dynamic API without\n\t\t\tgenerating proxy classes. Supports $filter/$select/$expand/$orderby/$search/$compute/$apply, server-driven\n\t\t\tpaging, delta queries, batch (multipart and JSON), functions and actions, media streams, ETags and\n\t\t\tasynchronous requests.\n\n\t\t\tCommonly used types:\n\t\t\tKuwa.OData.Client.ODataClient\n\t\t\tKuwa.OData.Client.ODataClientSettings\n\t\t\tKuwa.OData.Client.ODataBatch",
